{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>1000 Words 收錄西班牙文、法文、德文、意大利文、葡萄牙文、普通話、日文、韓文、俄文與阿拉伯文各一千個最常用單字，每個語言按自身次序排列，而非由英文清單翻譯而成。它只做一件事：讓你記住這些字，並誠實記錄已掌握多少，適合想快速打好外語詞彙基礎的學習者。現時原價 US $0.99，限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>滑動卡片牢記千個單字</h2>\n<p>卡片按學習次序排列，每節先出現最關鍵的字詞。點按揭示意義，認識向右滑，不認識向左滑，答錯的字會稍後重現。任何卡片或測驗答案都可點按 Listen 聽取內置語音。標記為已認識的字會安排翌日重測，之後每次成功便延長間隔，答錯則立即重排。程式完全離線運作，毋須帳戶，亦無廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-81-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-82-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-83-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-84-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-85-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-86-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：1000 Words – Swipe &amp; Learn</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T02:59:40.042095+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}